Package: undefined-player
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: pipewire-audio
Description: minimal Vulkan-accelerated Wayland video player
 undefined-player decodes video through FFmpeg, presents it through Vulkan and
 libplacebo, and sends audio through SDL3's PipeWire backend. It provides a
 borderless Wayland interface, embedded subtitle support, HDR metadata
 handling, and MPRIS desktop integration.
